{
  "_comment": "Which skills a kind of work requires. devkit enforces them: (1) the session catalog lists them by kind of work, (2) briefs for Claude subagents get the skills appended, (3) the Stop hook refuses to finish a turn that changed matching files without loading the skills, once per skill per session. `files` are globs on changed paths; `content` is a regex checked in changed files that match `files`; `activities` are the kinds of work (ids from the crew's RACI) the model declares for a step or a brief; `commands` are command words the agent runs. Nothing matches the developer's words: they can be in any language (crew gap review, C13), and the model picks skills from the catalog it gets at session start. Extend or override with `skills.rules` in ~/.config/devkit/config.json; turn enforcement off with `skills.enforce: false`.",
